      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "issue",
      "cat-harness:section": "Size and shape",
      "prov:value": "which is the\ndirect motivation for the `content/` → `folio/` rename in\n[the issue's comment](https://github.com/litlfred/folio-assistant/issues/223#issuecomment-5726628913).",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
